instructions include retaining original conversation content in short-term logs and promoting valuable content into a permanent long-term layer, but do not define consent, redaction, review, storage location, deletion, or retention limits.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Permanent memory persistence is explicitly requested for selected content, and raw short-term trace logs are also requested, without documented user controls or reversibility.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is local session-memory distillation, and the instructions align with that by reading session text, extracting identity, preferences, tasks, and knowledge, and producing traceable summaries.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Review this skill before installing if your conversations may contain credentials, private personal details, business data, or other sensitive information. Use it only with inputs you are comfortable retaining, and require a clear storage location, review step, redaction process, and deletion path before applying long-term memory changes.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The retention of session logs and extracted personal/task knowledge is expected for this memory skill, but the artifact supports the concern that persistence is under-scoped and lacks privacy controls.\n[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese-only wording is visible in the artifact and does not by itself indicate unsafe behavior; users who do not read Chinese may need clearer locale disclosure.\n[other] expected: The static scan's retention concern is supported by the artifact text about raw short-term logs and permanent long-term memory; no destructive, deceptive, or exfiltration behavior was found.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789532764570}}}}}